      <marc:subfield code="a">Dr. Orloff offers 365 days of self-care meditations, reflections, and journaling prompts to help prevent daily stress and burnout. Empaths bring many contributions to the world—they are healers, creatives, friends, lovers, and innovators in the workplace. Yet, highly sensitive empaths often sacrifice their own well-being, giving too much and absorbing the stress of others. In a world that can be exhausting, Dr. Orloff provides practical tools to help readers resist overwhelm and embrace the special calling they’ve been given</marc:subfield>
